  "bio": "Scott Hill is a highly skilled illustrative tattoo artist based in Closter, United States. Clients appreciate his impeccable cleanliness both in his technique and his workspace, ensuring a safe and hygienic experience. Hill's dedication to cleanliness is matched only by his talent in creating vivid, custom art pieces.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Closter, New Jersey, United States\n\n𝐓𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐨𝐨 & 𝐁𝐨𝐝𝐲 𝐏𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐢𝐧𝐠\nBy appointment or walk-in when available | 201.297.7977 \n⚡️Custom Art by⚡️\nScott Hill, Damon Sorrenti",
